ll commands. If you have a helpdesk need, please describe it and I'll be happy to assist!\"\n}\n```", "input_tokens": 14, "output_tokens": 359, "cached_tokens": 0, "cost": 0.005427, "retries": 0}, "latency_ms": 9067.407299997285}]}
